'''''Ten-Lords' Decree and Calamity's Remnant''''' is an [[Adventure Mission]] on [[The Xianzhou Luofu]].

==Steps==
# Talk to your teammates and gain an understanding of the situation
# (Optional) Talk to your teammates and gain an understanding of the situation
# Escort Xueyi to the Artisanship Commission's dock
# Advance with the help of Diting
# Escort Xueyi to the Artisanship Commission's dock
# Destroy the abominations and clear up the pollution generated by the Ambrosial Arbor

