===Talk to your teammates and gain an understanding of the situation{{subst:void|<!--202031701-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Artisanship Commission|With starskiff navigation, an error of mere millidegrees can result in misnavigation by lightyears. Thanks to Sushang's guidance and protection, Luocha and you arrived at the plagued Artisanship Commission due to the rebirth of Ambrosial Arbor and saved the young judge, Xueyi.<br />Xueyi requested you to escort her away from the place. Talk to your friends and see what they plan to do.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:'''Sushang:''' So this is the Luofu's Ambrosial Arbor? It's my first time seeing it.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Aren't you a Cloud Knight?
:'''Sushang:''' Clouds Knights don't visit the Ambrosial Arbor without a reason, plus I'm new here...
:'''Sushang:''' The Luofu's plaguemark is a tree, while the Yaoqing's is a moon. Ha, I think we got the better one.
:'''Luocha:''' ...I heard that the Ambrosial Arbor shriveled and died a long time ago... How could it suddenly spring back to life and start growing again?
----
:'''Xueyi:''' The influence of the Stellaron... There's no time for explanations &mdash; we must return to the Ten-Lords Commission! I'm wounded &mdash; I need your assistance in getting there. Once we get to Starskiff Jetty, you can go your separate ways.
:'''Luocha and Dan Heng:''' ...
:'''Sushang:''' ...Well, there's nothing else for it, we're duty-bound to help the Ten-Lords Commission...
----

;(Talk to Luocha)
:'''Luocha:''' Hehe, I did not expect such a short journey to be filled with so many twists and turns.
:'''Luocha:''' How does it feel, Master Dan Heng, to be a subject of the Ten-Lords Commission?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's a pleasure.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's a pain.
:'''Luocha:''' A good answer, short and to the point. It would seem I've been unsuccessful in de-tangling myself of matters thus far...
:'''Luocha:''' I suggest we hasten to Starskiff Jetty and send this Judge of the Ten-Lords Commission on her way &mdash; we must continue our own journeys as soon as possible.

;(Talk to Sushang)
:'''Sushang:''' Uh, sorry... All Cloud Knights answer to the Ten-Lords Commission. Duty calls...
:'''Sushang:''' Apologies for asking you to stick with me a bit longer. I'll treat you guys when I get you back to safety.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm not a Cloud Knight.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's go our separate ways now.
:'''Sushang:''' Um... I guess you could slip away and find a safe spot to hide. I'll come back and get you once I've sent her on her way.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No need. I operate alone.
::'''Sushang:''' Not a smart way to operate. The Luofu is more dangerous than ever &mdash; I can't let you put yourself in harm's way.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Hmm, in that case...
:'''Sushang:''' Come onnnn⁓ Together is better!

;(Talk to Xueyi)
:'''Xueyi:''' You look familiar.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I think you're mistaken.
::'''Xueyi:''' Hmm... Maybe.
::'''Xueyi:''' I ran your facial profile against the records in The Shackling Prison just now. Indeed, there were no matches to be found.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...
::'''Xueyi:''' Don't be nervous. I ran your facial profile against the records in The Shackling Prison just now. Indeed, there were no matches to be found.
:'''Xueyi:''' ...
{{Dialogue End}}

